                    Performance Marketing & Data Analytics
                </span>
                <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-6 leading-tight">
                    Driving verifiable growth through precision paid media and SEO.
                </h1>
                <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-400 mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
                    Senior specialist focused on profitable customer acquisition, rigorous data reporting, and scalable search optimization without the vanity metrics.
                </p>
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
                    <a href="#contact" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 text-base font-semibold text-white bg-blue-600 rounded-xl hover:bg-blue-500 transition-all shadow-lg shadow-blue-600/20">
