                            03
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Analytics & Reporting</h4>
                        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                            Custom reporting dashboards and attribution setups that turn raw metrics into clear, actionable business decisions without data noise.
                        </p>
