                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="relative pl-8 border-l border-slate-800">
                        <div class="absolute -left-1.5 top-1.5 w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-slate-700 ring-4 ring-slate-950"></div>
                        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Previous Years</span>
                        <h4 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-1">Performance Marketing & SEO Lead</h4>
                        <p class="text-slate-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                            Managed multi-channel ad spend, optimized conversion funnels, and led cross-functional reporting efforts to ensure transparent, profitable campaign scaling.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
