                    <a href="https://linkedin.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="px-8 py-4 text-base font-semibold text-slate-300 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl hover:bg-slate-800 hover:text-white transition-all">
